    <div class=3D"cards">
      <div class=3D"card">
        <span class=3D"tag">pattern</span>
        <div class=3D"q">Property, or new individual?</div>
        <div class=3D"a">Does this fact change or get re-measured? No =E2=
=86=92 literal on the node.
        Yes, or does it need its own metadata =E2=86=92 a new linked indivi=
dual, never an overwrite.</div>
      </div>
      <div class=3D"card">
        <span class=3D"tag">date</span>
        <div class=3D"q">Interval, or instant?</div>
        <div class=3D"a">Marking when a relationship was true =E2=86=92 <co=
de>validFrom</code>/<code>validTo</code>,
        leave <code>validTo</code> unset until closed. Marking when a fact =
was observed =E2=86=92
        <code>timestamp</code>/<code>observedAt</code>, one per measurement=
, forever.</div>
      </div>
      <div class=3D"card">
        <span class=3D"tag">graph</span>
        <div class=3D"q">Which named graph?</div>
        <div class=3D"a">Static and rarely changes =E2=86=92 the fixed tbox=
/reference/rules graphs.
        Written by an agent on a given day/quarter =E2=86=92 a fresh <code>=
ingest:{agent}:{date}</code>
        graph. Never write two batches into the same dated graph.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
